                        %mi x
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} J \supset \{i_x\}
            %p
              Now since the function
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f
              defining the subset is cofinal, there would exist
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
